%% description: Compare the optional additions refusal, the separate teapot response and the WHEN exchange without inferring a successful fallback.
sequenceDiagram
    participant client as Client
    participant teapot as Teapot
    participant coffee_pot as Coffee Pot
    client->>teapot: BREW coffee
    teapot-->>client: 418 I'm a teapot
    Note over teapot: Body MAY be short and stout
    client->>coffee_pot: BREW with Accept-Additions
    opt additions unavailable
        coffee_pot-->>client: 406 Not Acceptable
        Note over coffee_pot,client: Available additions SHOULD accompany 406
    end
    Note over client,coffee_pot: Separate scene with milk offered
    client->>coffee_pot: WHEN

